{"text": "Ani arrived in London on a grey Monday morning with a small suitcase. She looked at her map, but the streets were very confusing. So she asked a friendly young man, 'Excuse me, could you help me? I'm looking for the Rose Hotel.' He showed her the way, and soon she was walking down a beautiful white street. At last, she found the little hotel and rang the bell. In the evening, she watched the sunset over the Thames and felt proud of herself.", "words": [[0.3, 0.5], [0.6, 1.06], [1.1, 1.18], [1.28, 1.7], [1.9, 2.0], [2.04, 2.07], [2.16, 2.38], [2.48, 2.84], [2.94, 3.36], [3.5, 3.64], [3.68, 3.71], [3.82, 4.12], [4.24, 5.0], [6.3, 6.4], [6.5, 6.74], [6.8, 6.9], [6.96, 7.06], [7.12, 7.44], [7.92, 8.06], [8.1, 8.2], [8.28, 8.74], [8.8, 8.94], [9.0, 9.26], [9.36, 10.1], [11.4, 11.5], [11.66, 11.76], [11.92, 12.26], [12.3, 12.33], [12.42, 12.82], [12.9, 13.12], [13.18, 13.52], [13.84, 14.52], [14.58, 14.64], [15.14, 15.3], [15.32, 15.4], [15.48, 15.66], [15.74, 15.82], [16.56, 16.68], [16.76, 17.1], [17.2, 17.32], [17.34, 17.42], [17.52, 17.9], [17.96, 18.76], [19.78, 19.84], [19.98, 20.26], [20.3, 20.38], [20.42, 20.5], [20.58, 20.86], [21.34, 21.48], [21.62, 21.86], [21.98, 22.06], [22.12, 22.24], [22.32, 22.72], [22.78, 23.08], [23.16, 23.19], [23.28, 23.84], [23.92, 24.22], [24.28, 24.68], [26.02, 26.12], [26.24, 26.72], [27.12, 27.2], [27.32, 27.6], [27.66, 27.72], [27.78, 28.08], [28.16, 28.68], [28.86, 28.98], [29.04, 29.24], [29.3, 29.38], [29.42, 29.7], [31.0, 31.08], [31.12, 31.22], [31.34, 31.8], [32.18, 32.28], [32.38, 32.72], [32.76, 32.84], [32.94, 33.48], [33.56, 33.76], [33.78, 33.88], [33.96, 34.44], [34.58, 34.7], [34.78, 35.04], [35.14, 35.42], [35.46, 35.54], [35.58, 36.281]], "scenes": [0.0, 5.97, 11.07, 19.49, 25.71, 30.71], "tag": "en-GB-SoniaNeural", "fx": "pb1", "aligned": "ctc1", "clamped": 1}